<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 7.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 7.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 163.64     0.99</p>
<p> 2   Centro Prop	    16.31     2.13</p>
<p> 3   MT Leyshon Gold	13.51     1.85</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.74     1.01</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.70     0.77</p>
<p> 6   Natl Consol	     9.57     0.94</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 9.09     1.11</p>
